  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional and budget support programme for the Decentralised      Management of Regional Roads aimed at (i) increase Government         capacity to plan and manage interventions in the regional road        network, (ii) to increase private sector capacity to carry out road   works activities and (iii) to provide employment opportunities for    rural communities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutions- och budgetst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r &quot;decentraliserad f&#xf6;rvaltning av      regionala v&#xe4;gar&quot; med m&#xe5;let att i) &#xf6;ka v&#xe4;gf&#xf6;rvaltningens kapacitet att planera och f&#xf6;rvalta det regionala v&#xe4;garn&#xe4;tet, ii) &#xf6;ka privata        sektorns kapacitet att utf&#xf6;ra v&#xe4;gjobb; iii) att skapa                 arbetstillf&#xe4;llen p&#xe5; landsbygden.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional and budget support programme for the Decentralised Management of Regional Roads aimed at: 

(i) increase Government capacity to plan and manage interventions in the regional road network,
(ii) to increase private sector capacity to carry out road works activities and
(iii) to provide employment opportunities for rural communities.</narrative>
  </description>
